sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor TA as Tenant Admin
    participant UI as Tenant Operations page
    participant Dialog as ConfirmActionDialog or DecisionDialog
    participant API as Tenant API
    participant Scope as Tenant and site authorization
    participant Service as Domain service
    participant Audit as Audit writer
    participant DB as Tenant database

    TA->>UI: Choose risky action in current scope

    alt Role or site assignment
        UI->>UI: Validate canonical role and proposed site assignments
        alt Invalid configuration
            Note over UI: PLATFORM_ADMIN, empty site-scoped role, duplicate, unknown, or cross-tenant site
            UI-->>TA: Inline error; do not submit
        else Valid configuration
            UI->>Dialog: Show old and new role, sites, impact, and reason rule
        end
    else Access-request decision
        UI->>Dialog: Show request evidence, selected site, effect, and decision
        alt Reject without nonblank reason
            UI-->>TA: Inline reason validation; do not submit
        else Approve or valid rejection
            Dialog-->>TA: Confirm decision
        end
    else Commissioning action
        UI->>API: Request current map status and lock version
        alt Direct edit of published map
            API-->>UI: Published version is not editable
            UI-->>TA: Offer create draft from source image and valid calibration
            TA->>UI: Create draft
            UI->>API: Create draft and obtain lock version
            API-->>UI: Draft only
        else Draft publish or archived rollback
            API-->>UI: Current draft or archived candidate
        end
        alt Rollback without nonblank reason
            UI-->>TA: Inline reason validation; do not submit
        else Publish after validation or reasoned rollback
            UI->>Dialog: Show site, camera, map version, impact, and reason rule
        end
    end

    TA->>Dialog: Confirm with required reason where applicable
    Dialog->>UI: Lock duplicate submission and show pending state
    UI->>API: Send action, scope, reason, If-Match or idempotency context
    API->>Scope: Verify TENANT_ADMIN, tenant context, resource site and child ownership

    alt Scope denied or resource unavailable
        Scope-->>API: 403 or non-disclosing 404
        API-->>UI: Generic unavailable result
        UI->>Dialog: Keep safe context or return to safe parent
        Dialog-->>TA: No cross-tenant or cross-site data disclosure
    else Scope allowed
        Scope-->>API: Permit authorized action
        API->>Service: Validate current state and execute action

        alt Stale lock, stale request, or validation failure
            Service-->>API: Conflict or validation result
            API-->>UI: Prior state remains authoritative
            UI->>Dialog: Keep safe input; refresh or retry
        else Valid action
            Service->>DB: Write resource or decision mutation
            Service->>Audit: Write actor, scope, target, action, reason, outcome
            Audit->>DB: Persist audit record in same transaction

            alt Audit write fails
                DB-->>Audit: Audit failure
                Audit-->>Service: Fail transaction
                Service-->>API: Action not completed
                API-->>UI: Failure; never claim success
                UI->>Dialog: Restore focus and offer retry
            else Audit written
                DB-->>Audit: Audit or correlation reference
                Audit-->>Service: Durable outcome
                Service-->>API: Updated resource and audit outcome
                API-->>UI: Confirmed server result
                UI->>UI: Refresh selected scope or tenant-wide list
                UI-->>TA: Inline durable outcome; toast is supplementary only
            end
        end
    end

    Note over TA,DB: Selected site narrows operational views; it never creates authorization.
    Note over API,Scope: Published commissioning maps are read-only; change requires new draft, validation, and confirmation.
